  "name": "BlackCore",
  "slug": "blackcore",
  "teaser": "New black (or close to) variants of weapon mods and gear",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1345.jpg",
  "downloads": 184567,
  "favourites_count": 3,
  "description": "<p><strong>SPT/EFT is currently in a volatile state for content mods. This makes it very challenging to keep up with updating custom items. New scripts are added to gear, weapons, etc, every update. Stay on SPT 3.10 for the best experience when it comes to these kinds of mods.</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aMkvZ1y.jpg\" alt=\"aMkvZ1y.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><em>The weapon paints are only available in SPT versions below SPT 3.11. This is due to BSG implementing skins to the game. The asset bundles for modded weapons stopped working, so I had to remove them from BlackCore for the mod to function. From 3.11, only black weapon attachments were added.</em></p>\n<p>Turn FDE attachments, weapons, and gear in the game to black with BlackCore, over 50 items retextured with some of them adding a new spice to the textures. Topographic lines, skulls, etc. A lot of effort went into making these retextures. Enjoy!</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KMIJ3Fr.png\" alt=\"KMIJ3Fr.png\" />How you install this mod:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3K6YzwF.png\" alt=\"3K6YzwF.png\" /> Download <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1412-painter/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Painter</a></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3K6YzwF.png\" alt=\"3K6YzwF.png\" /> Drag the folder in the zip file into your SPT directory</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3K6YzwF.png\" alt=\"3K6YzwF.png\" /> Download this mod</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3K6YzwF.png\" alt=\"3K6YzwF.png\" /> Drag the folder in the zip file into your SPT directory</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iWVQeUV.png\" alt=\"iWVQeUV.png\" />You did it!</p>\n<p>If you use custom load order, you have to make sure Painter is loading before my other mods.</p>\n<h3><strong>Weapon Mods</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>AN/PEQ-15 tactical device (Black)</li>\n<li>EOTech EXPS3 holographic sight (Black)</li>\n<li>Insight WMX200 tactical flashlight (Black)</li>\n<li>5.56x45 HK 30 STANAG polymer 30-round magazine (Black)</li>\n<li>AR-15 Daniel Defense RIS II FSP 9.5 handguard (Black)</li>\n<li>Bastion Upper Reciever (Topographic)</li>\n<li>Holosun LS321 Tactical device (Black)</li>\n<li>AR-15 Noveske Upper Reciever (Topographic)</li>\n<li>Vortex Razor HD Gen.2 (Black)</li>\n<li>SIG TANGO6T 1-6x24 30mm riflescope (Black)</li>\n<li>Wilcox RAPTAR ES Tactical Rangefinder (Black)</li>\n<li>Steyr AUG 5.56x45 30-round magazine (Black)</li>\n<li>SilencerCo Hybrid 46 multi-caliber sound suppressor (Special)</li>\n<li>M14 TROY S.A.S.S. Chassis stock (Black)</li>\n<li>VPO-101 Vepr-Hunter stock (Black)</li>\n<li>AK Magpul MOE pistol grip (Special)</li>\n<li>AK Zenit PT-1 stock (Special)</li>\n<li>RD-704 SLR ION Lite gasblock / handguard (Special)</li>\n<li>AK TWS Dog Leg Rail dust cover (Special)</li>\n<li>Glock Viper Cut pistol slide (Special)</li>\n<li>AK-74 5.45x39 6L23 30-round magazine (Special)</li>\n<li>Angled Grip (Custom Foregrip)</li>\n<li>AR-15 Magpul MOE SL-K buttstock (Black)</li>\n<li>AR-15 Vltor MUR-1S 5.56x45 upper receiver (Painter Edition)</li>\n<li>Mk47 Resolute 7.62x39 upper receiver (Topographic)</li>\n<li>AR-15 Noveske Gen.3 5.56x45 upper receiver (Topographic)</li>\n<li>AR-15 Precision Reflex GEN III Delta Carbon handguard (Black)</li>\n<li>Glock 17 9x19 pistol slide (Topographic)</li>\n<li>MCX SPEAR 6.8x51 upper receiver (Black)</li>\n<li>AR-10 7.62x51 Lancer L7AWM 20-round magazine (Black)</li>\n<li>AR-10 7.62x51 Lancer L7AWM 25-round magazine (Black)</li>\n<li>AR-15 SIG M400 Reduced Angle Pistol Grip</li>\n<li>MCX SPEAR 11 inch M-LOK handguard (Black)</li>\n<li>MCX SPEAR charging handle (Black)</li>\n<li>MCX SPEAR SLX68-MG-QD 6.8x51 sound suppressor (Black)</li>\n<li>MCX/MPX folding stock adapter buffer tube (Black)</li>\n<li>AR-15 FAB Defense GL-CORE black buttstock</li>\n<li>AR-15 Magpul MOE SL-K buttstock (Black)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Weapons</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Colt M4A1 5.56x45 assault rifle (Topographic)</li>\n<li>Colt M4A1 5.56x45 assault rifle (Flames)</li>\n<li>Colt M4A1 5.56x45 assault rifle (Painter Edition)</li>\n<li>Kalashnikov AK-103 7.62x39 assault rifle (Topographic)</li>\n<li>Remington R11 RSASS (Black)</li>\n<li>CMMG Mk47 Mutant (Topographic)</li>\n<li>SIG MCX SPEAR 6.8x51 assault rifle (Black)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong><strong>Gear</strong></strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Ars Arma CPC MOD.1 plate carrier (Black)</li>\n<li>5.11 Tactical TacTec plate carrier (Black)</li>\n<li>WARTECH TV-110 plate carrier (Black)</li>\n<li>Crye Precision AVS plate carrier (Black)</li>\n<li>SLAAP Armor Plate (Skull)</li>\n<li>Black Balaclava</li>\n<li>Gradient Sunglasses</li>\n<li>L3Harris GPNVG-18 night vision goggles (Black)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XgB0GfA.jpg\" alt=\"Black_1\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kY2eNEi.jpg\" alt=\"kY2eNEi.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OybIjDc.jpg\" alt=\"OybIjDc.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GgrUGZh.jpg\" alt=\"GgrUGZh.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><em>I do have a <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"http://ko-fi.com/moxopixel\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ko-Fi</a> if you want to leave a donation.</em></p>\n",
